{"availability":"available","full":"mohammad-alajlouni/mazad","name":"mazad","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-17T20:09:47Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:59:20Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://kutayyib.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.389Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.389Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.389Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.389Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Auction booklets, banners and social posts for real-estate selling agents — from one set of data, at the press of a button.","Kutayyib is a web platform for selling agents who run real-estate auctions. An agent enters the auction and its properties once and receives three print-ready publications that follow the official marketing and visual identity guide for auctions:","What is typed for the booklet is what appears on the banner and in the post, so no figure differs from one publication to the next. The interface and the generated documents are available in Arabic (right to left) and English."],"features":["the auction booklet (A4 PDF, in a print edition with QR codes and a digital edition with links),","a banner for each property, in six sizes from 2 × 2 m to 15 × 5 m,","social posts for X, Instagram and stories, with caption text.","One project, every publication. Auction data, properties, photographs and the selling agent's profile are entered once and shared by the booklet, the banners and the posts.","A wizard in the order of the booklet's pages. Four steps: auction and cover, properties, closing pages, generate."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mohammad-alajlouni/mazad/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"759f736669bbb5b6d285d38bdc090418cafe83215debe5949258f4bd089903c8","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:07.508Z"},"overviewCheckedAt"